"role=\"runtime\" linkend=\"gnome-icon-theme\"/>, <xref role=\"runtime\" "
"linkend=\"x-window-system\"/>, and <xref role=\"runtime\" linkend=\"yelp\"/>"
" for the built-in help functionality"
msgstr ""
"Um tema de ícones, como o <xref role=\"runtime\" linkend=\"adwaita-icon-"
"theme\"/>, <xref role=\"nodep\" linkend=\"oxygen-icons\"/> ou <xref "
"role=\"runtime\" linkend=\"gnome-icon-theme\"/>; <xref role=\"runtime\" "
"linkend=\"x-window-system\"/> e <xref role=\"runtime\" linkend=\"yelp\"/> "
"para a funcionalidade de ajuda integrada"

