msgid ""
"<xref linkend=\"dconf\"/> (to prevent some test failures), &gobject-"
"introspection;, <xref linkend=\"pygobject3\"/>, <xref linkend=\"valgrind\"/>"
" (for some tests), <ulink "
"url=\"https://dblatex.sourceforge.net/\">dblatex</ulink> (for PDF docs), "
"<ulink url=\"https://www.gnome-db.org/\">libgda</ulink>, <ulink "
"url=\"https://www.mono-project.com/\">Mono</ulink>, <ulink "
"url=\"https://pxlib.sourceforge.net/\">pxlib</ulink>, and <ulink "
"url=\"https://frodo.looijaard.name/project/psiconv\">Psiconv</ulink>"
msgstr ""
"<xref linkend=\"dconf\"/> (para evitar algumas falhas de testes), &gobject-"
"introspection;, <xref linkend=\"pygobject3\"/>, <xref linkend=\"valgrind\"/>"
" (para alguns testes), <ulink "
"url=\"https://dblatex.sourceforge.net/\">dblatex</ulink> (para documentos "
"PDF), <ulink url=\"https://www.gnome-db.org/\">libgda</ulink>, <ulink "
"url=\"https://www.mono-project.com/\">Mono</ulink>, <ulink "
"url=\"https://pxlib.sourceforge.net/\">pxlib</ulink> e <ulink "
"url=\"https://frodo.looijaard.name/project/psiconv\">Psiconv</ulink>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/xsoft/office/gnumeric.xml:114
#, xml-text
msgid "Installation of Gnumeric"
msgstr "Instalação do Gnumeric"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/xsoft/office/gnumeric.xml:124
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Install <application>Gnumeric</application> by running the following "
"commands:"
msgstr ""
"Instale o <application>Gnumeric</application> executando os seguintes "
"comandos:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/xsoft/office/gnumeric.xml:128
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>./configure --prefix=/usr  &amp;&amp;\n"
"make</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>./configure --prefix=/usr  &amp;&amp;\n"
"make</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/xsoft/office/gnumeric.xml:132
#, xml-text
msgid "This package must be installed before the test suite is run."
msgstr ""
"Esse pacote precisa ser instalado antes da suíte de teste ser executada."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/xsoft/office/gnumeric.xml:136
#, xml-text
msgid "Now, as the <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr ""
"Agora, como o(a) usuário(a) <systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem>:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/xsoft/office/gnumeric.xml:139
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>make install</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>make install</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/xsoft/office/gnumeric.xml:142
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"To run the tests, issue <command>make check</command>.  Tests should be run "
"from an active X session, and <xref linkend=\"dconf\"/> should be installed "
"to prevent some failures.  Four tests are known to fail.  Additional "
"failures may occur if valgrind is installed."
msgstr ""
"Para executar os testes, emita <command>make check</command>. Os testes "
"deveriam ser executados a partir de uma sessão ativa do X e <xref "
"linkend=\"dconf\"/> deveria ser instalado para evitar algumas falhas. Quatro"
" testes são conhecidos por falharem. Falhas adicionais possivelmente ocorram"
" se valgrind estiver instalado."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/xsoft/office/gnumeric.xml:158
#, xml-text
msgid "Command Explanations"
msgstr "Explicações do Comando"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/xsoft/office/gnumeric.xml:161
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<option>--enable-pdfdocs</option>: Use this switch if you have installed "
"dblatex and wish to create PDF docs."
msgstr ""
"<option>--enable-pdfdocs</option>: Use essa chave se você tiver instalado o "
"dblatex e desejar criar documentos PDF."

